<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Packers And Movers In Supply
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What GST rate applies to Packers And Movers services in Supply?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Packers and movers in Supply are subject to the standard GST rate of 18% on the total service charge, which includes freight, packing, and insurance. Businesses can claim input tax credit if they have a valid GST registration, while residential customers pay the tax as part of the final invoice.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer packaging protect my household items during the 850 km transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The 7‑layer system combines high‑density bubble wrap, corrugated sheets, foam edge protectors, stretch film, and custom wooden crates. Each layer absorbs shocks, prevents moisture ingress, and distributes weight evenly, ensuring that delicate items like glassware, electronics, and temple idols arrive intact even over long highway journeys.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I claim reimbursement from my employer or a government department for the moving cost?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers provides GST‑compliant invoices, e‑Way bills, and detailed cost breakdowns that meet IBA and ISO standards. These documents are accepted by central and state government bodies, PSUs, and corporate finance departments for full reimbursement.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required at the checkposts along the Supply‑to‑Hub route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">At each state checkpost you must present a valid GST invoice, the e‑Way bill generated for the shipment, vehicle registration, driver’s licence, and a copy of the insurance policy. Our team prepares these documents in advance to avoid delays.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the insurance value determined for my belongings?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Customers declare the total value of their items during the quoting process. Our IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covers up to 100% of this declared value, with premiums calculated as a small percentage of the total. In case of loss, claim settlement follows a streamlined documentation procedure.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is there a low‑cost moving option without compromising safety?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad offers a ‘Smart Pack’ plan that uses essential protective layers and shared container space, reducing freight costs while still providing full insurance coverage. This option is ideal for budget‑conscious customers who need reliable, damage‑free relocation.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I track my shipment in real time during the Supply to Destination Hub transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">All our fleet vehicles are equipped with satellite GPS units that feed live location data to our customer portal. Once the move is scheduled, you receive a secure login to view real‑time progress, estimated arrival times, and any route alerts.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
